{"id":"wb-8-364","name":"许昌文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"许昌文庙","text":"许昌文庙位于中国河南省许昌市魏都区文庙前街南大街75号，与春秋楼毗邻，2000年被列为河南省文物保护单位，2019年10月7日被公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。\n许昌文庙始建于唐代，最初庙址在许昌城东南角，后几经重建，至清道光年间，许昌文庙形成现有格局。现存影壁、泮池、大成门、大成殿等建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AE%B8%E6%98%8C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91072425,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91072425","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ee620239180baabdf4dea29d.jpg","title":"20260111_Xuchang_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260111_Xuchang_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/20260111_Xuchang_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​许昌文庙 大成殿","width":320,"height":213}}